"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5167520","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4168680-1846651706686701","game_id":"steam-4168680","kind":"announcement","title":"Doom Keeper - About","summary":"Steam Next Fest starts tomorrow, and I want to briefly talk about Doom Keeper: what kind of game it is, how its gameplay is built, and which design ideas are at its core. Let me say upfront: I’m not trying to reinvent the wheel or turn action roguelikes upside down. I mostly wanted to experiment with some conventions that personally kept me from fully enjoying games in the genre. 1. The build starts with the character.Each character has an initial concept shaped by a weapon, passive traits, an a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:51:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686701","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4168680-1846018067943770","game_id":"steam-4168680","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.4.0","summary":"Version 0.4.0Greetings! Here's what's coming your way:Gameplay & BalanceDroids: Significantly increased base damage, scaling, and attack speed. However, reduced their attack range.Waves & Run Time: The number of waves has been reduced to 16. Base wave durations are slightly increased, but the overall run time is now shorter, targeting 20–25 minutes.Warden: Slightly buffed the character's weapon to make it more beginner-friendly.Survivability: Lifesteal and Regeneration have been nerfed.Items & E","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T11:40:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943770","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4168680-1846018067927180","game_id":"steam-4168680","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.3.0","summary":"Version 0.3.0 — Polish & BalanceHey everyone!Version 0.3.0 is here! This update brings some polish, balance adjustments, and fixes based on your feedback.Here's a quick overview of what's changed:Gameplay & BalanceSlightly reduced the base speed and spawn rate of all enemies.Slightly increased the player's base movement speed.Slightly reduced base enemy damage. This should be more noticeable during the early waves, while having very little impact on the late game.Made numerous small balance adju","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T19:05:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927180","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4168680-1842212951312827","game_id":"steam-4168680","kind":"announcement","title":"The Doom Keeper Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"The Doom Keeper Demo Is Now Available!No keys, no sign-ups.Just press “Download Demo” and try it.The demo is just a small part of the full experience, but it gives a chance to try out the starting characters and get familiar with the basics of the game.We’ll be keeping a close eye on your feedback, so if you run into any bugs, have suggestions, or simply want to share your thoughts, join our Discord and let us know what you think!Your feedback means a lot to us and will help us improve Doom Keep","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T09:36:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951312827","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4168680":{"last_attempt_at